      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>From the title, I was expecting Ra and fellows against Gloomy, Apostate, or the Matriarch. &nbsp;Imagine my surprise when I got none of those things. &nbsp;I supose the &quot;Museum&quot; should have been a clue. &nbsp;Oh well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Mint. &nbsp;I was too careless with Parse&#39;s attacks on Miss Info, and she got knocked out soon after the flip. &nbsp;But she did a great job of manipulating the deck before that, and got in some good hits. &nbsp;So that was fine. &nbsp;I intentionally let the Wrathful Retribution slip away to kill that first diversion. &nbsp;Maybe not the best choice, but Fanatic did very well without it. &nbsp;KNYFE spent the first half the game bored and lonely, but she quickly made up for it on the other end.</p>",
