    {
      "id": 188750,
      "name": "Reverend Pete",
      "username": "Reverend_Pete",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-02-07T14:30:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parse used Gauge like it was going out of style, and that meant there weren't really any challenges or surprises here. That's what Parse is for, right? Minimizing challenge and surprise?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After Fanatic let off a huge Wrathful Retribution, I thought that Miss Information might fall to the Spike Trap. It wasn't quite enough, as she was left with 2HP, so Parse had to finish her off with an Impossible Shot. Ah, well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parse at 11HP, Fanatic at 8HP and KNYFE at 15HP.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:14:46.947Z",
